      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1994, Patrick Stewart and William Shatner filmed a scene of Star Trek Generations in the Tehachapi mountains, bringing Hollywood to the ridge.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
